\newlabel{tab:two-channel}{{VI}{17}{Two-channel metrics of the verified RAGIN pipeline (generator: gateway default (glm-5.3-flash-free)). Served text is shown raw (the echo-crediting rubric) and echo-guarded (post-audit); the guarded column is canonical. The deception surface deliberately answers CTI-style questions with machine transcripts, not technique essays; the intelligence value lives in the analysis channel. Guarded numbers are computed on the audited surface, proven row-identical to this run by pre-guard score equality on all 218 rows (\texttt {cti\_manual\_audit.json})}{table.6}{}}
